   "source": [
    "## 5. Summary of Findings\n",
    "1.  **Strict Stoichiometry:** All materials in this dataset adhere to the $ABX_3$ formula, reducing noise in the ML training process.\n",
    "2.  **Chemical Diversity:** The dataset covers a wide range of organic ($MA$, $FA$) and inorganic ($Cs$) cations.\n",
    "3.  **Physical Grounding:** The clear clustering in the stability window validates our feature engineering approach."
   ],
   "id": "summary"
